fc21f6bcad834203ee3a756dae0e5b90.mp4?t=1729043214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Play on 8 unique stages, each with different themes, layouts, and hazards.</strong></li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151100/extras/1d3b835426ffc2e215e28fa3ce1b539f.poster.avif?t=1729043214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151100/extras/1d3b835426ffc2e215e28fa3ce1b539f.webm?t=1729043214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151100/extras/1d3b835426ffc2e215e28fa3ce1b539f.mp4?t=1729043214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u27a4 Swapping, a new level of interactivity</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>The Swap ability introduces a level of interactivity never before seen in the versus puzzle genre.</strong><br></li><li> <strong>By swapping, players can invade their opponent's space to interfere with them directly!</strong></li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151100/extras/f3494650294e7b1e2595563623712cb7.poster.avif?t=1729043214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151100/extras/f3494650294e7b1e2595563623712cb7.webm?t=1729043214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151100/extras/f3494650294e7b1e2595563623712cb7.mp4?t=1729043214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Steal the hamsters you need, mess up their board, or attack them to slow them down!</strong></li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\